open-seo-mcp-skills — https://github.com/Ryze-AI-Adgent/open-seo-mcp-skills
(read at commit 81ac50e95131c8172b3afd9ac4994de6ae455a04)

What was adapted:
  - skills/seo-audit/SKILL.md and skills/rank-tracking/SKILL.md in this repository are adapted
    from that project's skills of the same names (workflow, output order, fallbacks), rewritten
    for this plugin's tools.
  - The audit lenses and thresholds in gsc_core/analysis.py follow those skills: CTR anomalies
    at good positions (position <= 5 with CTR < 2% is kept as the fallback rule), striking
    distance at positions 8-20, decaying pages (clicks down 30% or more), cannibalisation,
    winners / losers / new / lost, and ranking losers by clicks lost.
  - The split of the plugin into one tool per job (audit, rank tracking, ...) mirrors the
    split of those skills.

